{"id":"c096df80861122dd","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-consistency.md","title":"一致强 Kleene 固定点给出 KF 模型","display":"thm-KF-consistency — 一致强 Kleene 固定点给出 KF 模型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-KF-consistency"],"display":"thm-KF-consistency — 一致强 Kleene 固定点给出 KF 模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-KF-plus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-consistency — 一致强 Kleene 固定点给出 KF 模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" href=\"?note=c6dd3bfc0bc402ea\" title=\"91-df-KF-plus\">91-df-KF-plus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 为从空集生成的极小一致固定点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X_{\\min})\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X_{\\min})\\)</span> 为其经典闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是元层无矛盾证明性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}^{+}=\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}^{+}=\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}^{+})\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}^{+})\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正生成固定点存在且空种子闭包保持信息一致。固定点十三子句逐项验证 KF，信息一致性验证 CONS；标准数域上的任意谓词解释都满足完整对象归纳。由经典可靠性得无矛盾证明。\n这是在能进行该超限构造的元理论中的模型证明，不是 PA 内部证明 KF 一致性。旧断言以未验证的证明归约作前提，将书中的结果弱化成条件句；现给出明确模型。相对证明论强度另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a> 及原书 §15.3。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.7、Theorem 15.15、Lemma 15.17，印刷页 191、197、199，PDF 页 202、208、210。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF-plus","status":"resolved","id":"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF-plus]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ramified-truth","status":"resolved","id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"正生成固定点存在且空种子闭包保持信息一致。固定点十三子句逐项验证 KF，信息一致性验证 CONS；标准数域上的任意谓词解释都满足完整对象归纳。由经典可靠性得无矛盾证明。\n这是在能进行该超限构造的元理论中的模型证明，不是 PA 内部证明 KF 一致性。旧断言以未验证的证明归约作前提，将书中的结果弱化成条件句；现给出明确模型。相对证明论强度另见 [[91-df-ramified-truth]] 及原书 §15.3。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X_{\\min})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}^{+}=\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}^{+})\\land\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF}).","display":true}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["f276735320c6ad44","460308c7099a8386","c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","706acac2c3076a7b"]}